15
00:01:44,100 --> 00:01:52,260
There are three big problems with performance management. First, the bell curve, upon which

16
00:01:52,260 --> 00:01:57,200
all the rating categories are based, top performers, average performers, bottom performers,

17
00:01:57,700 --> 00:02:05,620
is no indicator of organizational performance. HR analyst Josh Burson's famous research titled

18
