The Myth of the Bell Curve actually showed that in any given time horizon, a few teams or people

19
00:02:13,000 --> 00:02:20,520
would have delivered disproportionate impact, many others would fall along a long tail, and a few would

20
00:02:20,520 --> 00:02:30,280
